**。\n\nPod `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` 中的 `app` 容器被硬限制在 64Mi 内存。根据日志证据（#3），该应用在持续处理 `GET /work` 请求时，其内存分配量呈现持续增长趋势（在数分钟内从 12MiB 攀升至 48MiB）。当内存分配触及或超过 64Mi 硬限制时，触发了操作系统的 OOM Killer 机制，导致容器以退出码 137 被强制终止，进而引发 Kubernetes 的 CrashLoopBackOff 重启循环。\n\n**证据编号引用**：\n- 崩溃原因及重启循环：`fact-8e1d9364eb6d`, `fact-0efb46c5a242`, `fact-ec4f7c51ce71`\n- 内存硬限制：`fact-3b02f7feeeb1`\n- 内存持续增长轨迹：`fact-logging-pattern`\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 53.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 81.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 81.8s (Evidence 74.4s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 149.792, "metrics": {"run_id": "b678864050b641b4", "mttr": {"value": "2.5m", "seconds": 149.79791903495789, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail":